  "body": "It's a shame we can't currently specify multiple poster image sources for a video element to be used depending on pixel density and size of the video element.\r\n\r\nI'd propose that there be a `posterset` attribute similar to img `srcset`, if expanding the `poster` attribute's inputs seems unwise.\r\n",
